                                       "then comes back."),
    ("stuck", "Stuck while starting", "Starting hangs before the login screen. After about 3 minutes it restarts "
                                      "by itself, 3 times, then comes back."),
    ("login-loop", "Login loop", "Logging in drops you back at the login screen. Log in again; after the second "
                                 "try it restarts by itself. After 3 rounds of that it comes back."),
    ("freeze", "Freeze", "The computer locks up about 20 seconds after the login screen shows. Hold the power "
